---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Shinobi SEO | SEO Company Philippines, studio of Bright Forge"
  description="Shinobi SEO is a Quezon City SEO company and a studio of Bright Forge SEO. Meet the dojo behind SEO services in the Philippines."
>
  <section class="py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="font-bangers text-5xl md:text-6xl text-center mb-8">
        Welcome to the <span class="text-anime-cyan">Dojo</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-16">
        <p>
          Shinobi SEO is an SEO agency in the Philippines with a shinobi theme and a serious parent.
          We work from Quezon City for brands that need search in Metro Manila, Cebu, Davao and across the country.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are a studio of <a href="https://brightforgeseo.com" class="text-anime-cyan underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-anime-pink">Bright Forge SEO</a>,
          the parent company. Bright Forge built the method: live-page inspection, source-locked content, independent QA, and reporting that does not call a job done without evidence.
          Shinobi wears the armour. Bright Forge holds the dojo rules.
        </p>
        <p>
          The squad is split on purpose. Content specialists write. Technical work stays on the live site, not a spreadsheet guess.
          Reporting and client communication stay separate from drafting. That is how we keep missions clean when several people touch the same brand.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not run one-size-fits-all packages. A cafe that needs Google Maps in QC is not the same mission as a national ecommerce catalogue.
          Scouting Jutsu, Code Ninjutsu, Territory Domination and Story Arc Mastery only get used when the page and the city justify them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-anime-panel border-4 border-black rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-[5px_5px_0_#FF2D55]">
          <div class="font-bangers text-3xl text-anime-pink mb-1">Quezon City</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Home dojo, Metro Manila</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-anime-panel border-4 border-black rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-[5px_5px_0_#00F5FF]">
          <div class="font-bangers text-3xl text-anime-cyan mb-1">Bright Forge</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Parent SEO agency</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-anime-panel border-4 border-black rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-[5px_5px_0_#FFE600]">
          <div class="font-bangers text-3xl text-anime-yellow mb-1">Evidence</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Before any Done claim</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-block px-10 py-5 bg-anime-pink text-white font-bangers text-2xl rounded-xl border-4 border-black shadow-[6px_6px_0_#00F5FF] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_#00F5FF] hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 transition-all"
        >
          Join the Dojo
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
